  "body": "More Than a Three-Bedroom Home - A Smarter Way to Live\r\n\r\nCCC Issued | Brand New | Macleans College Zone\r\n\r\nWelcome to 145D Bucklands Beach Road - a stylish, brand-new home delivering modern comfort, flexible living and an outstanding East Auckland lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOffering 3 spacious bedrooms plus a large upstairs Flexi-Room with its own wardrobe, there's plenty of room for a home office, second lounge, nursery, media room or extra family space.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the sleek modern kitchen, flowing effortlessly into the open-plan living and dining area and out to a sunny deck and fully fenced, low-maintenance backyard.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\n3 bedrooms + generous Flexi-Room with wardrobe\r\n2.5 bathrooms, including master ensuite\r\nModern kitchen with quality appliances\r\nLight-filled open-plan living\r\nSunny deck and easy-care backyard\r\nHeat pump and full insulation\r\nInternal-access garage\r\nZoned for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate  and Bucklands Beach Primary\r\nClose to beaches, Coastal walks, cafés and transport\r\n\r\nBrand new, beautifully presented and ready to enjoy - this is Bucklands Beach living made easy.",
